    <string name="walkthrough_acCurrency_body">Change the currency your money is shown in. Pick a new one and **every amount in the app converts** to it straight away.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_acCurrency_title">Choose your currency</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_acLanguage_body">Pick the language you want the app written in. Search the list to find yours quickly.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_acLanguage_title">Choose your language</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_acPassword_body">Change your password here. We will ask your two security questions first, so only you can do it.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_acPassword_title">Keeping your account safe</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_acPersonal_body">Tap here to see or change your name, phone number and monthly salary. Your salary is what the app uses to work out your budget, so keep it up to date.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_acPersonal_title">Your personal details</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_add_body">Tap here whenever you spend something. The more you add, the more useful everything else becomes.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_add_firstrun_body">Tap here to log your first one. Everything else on this screen comes to life once you do.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_add_firstrun_title">Start by adding an expense</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_add_title">Add what you spend</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_back">Back</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_count">Step %1$s of %2$s</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_duo_body">On the left, your lesson streak — tap it to carry on where you left off. On the right, guides on **spotting scams**, **sending money home**, and **handling debt**. Tap any one to read it.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_duo_title">Keep learning, and read up</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_exBudget_body">Transport, fun and other spending come out of an allowance worked out from your pay. This bar turns red if you go over it.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_exBudget_title">How much is left for wants</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_exCats_body">Tap a category to see everything you logged in it, add a new entry, or fix a mistake.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_exCats_title">Every category, one tap away</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_exSummary_body">Everything you spent, split into **fixed** bills that repeat, **variable** day-to-day spending, and any **extra** money that came in.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_exSummary_title">Your month at a glance</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_finish">Finish</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_finish_body">You are ready to go. Want to see this again? It is the **Take the tour** row on this screen.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_finish_title">That is everything</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_learn_body">Short lessons on money, in plain words. Finish one to unlock the next, and keep your streak going day by day.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_learn_title">Learn as you go</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_next">Next</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_repHero_body">One bar for each month you have tracked. Green means you hit your savings goal, red means you fell short.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_repHero_title">How past months went</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_repMonth_body">Tap a month to see its full report — the same charts as your home screen, plus every single thing you logged that month.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_repMonth_title">Open any month</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_replay">Take the tour</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_replay_subtitle">See how the app works</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_savings_body">The bar runs from nothing saved on the left to your goal on the right. The marker shows where you are — aim to move it towards the green.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_savings_title">Track your savings goal</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_skip">Skip the tour</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_spend_body">This circle splits your spending by category. Tap any colour, or any name in the list, to see just that one.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_spend_firstrun_body">It is empty for now. Add a few expenses and this circle fills in with a colour for each category.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_spend_firstrun_title">This is where your spending will show</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_spend_title">See where your money goes</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_start">Show me around</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_tip_body">One short piece of money advice, in plain words. Tap **Show me another** if you want a different one.</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_tip_title">A tip every day</string>
    <string name="walkthrough_welcome_body">Let us show you around. It takes about a minute, and you can stop any time.</string>
